Z||000029||Doni Hagan||12-21-2001||03:57 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>Lots of cool idea's. <BR>Now is there anyone who can help me out?<BR>I need a set of 87 GT wheels in 1/24 scale.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>If you can find one, the wheels in Monogram's<BR>BMW 635csi model has a set of BBS honeycombs which look just like the GT. They're chromed but that's nothing you can't fix. I'll look in my spare parts boxes and see if I have a set. If I find 'em, I'll e-mail you for your address.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>||||reg||1
